#chapter("ch-legend")[The legend]

Long ago, or at least since the last camp, there was a badge. It was a plain
badge. It told you your name and not much else. Then one night somebody
pressed Fire, and the badge laid an egg.

#egg-strip()

The egg hatched. Out came a pet. It was small, it was hungry, and it had
opinions. The pet needed food, water, sleep, fun and a wash. It did not need
a name, but you gave it one anyway. Since then nobody at BornHack has been
able to look at their badge without feeling a little bit responsible.

You are the keeper. This guide is the booklet that came in the box, if the
box had been a box. It starts with the buttons and ends with the secrets.
Read the first chapters and your pet will hatch, eat and sleep. Read the rest
and it may even live a long and happy life.

A pet that is looked after well stays. A pet that is neglected for too long
packs its bags and leaves. @ch-mood tells you how that happens, so that you
can stop it.

== The Unicorn Realm

Where do pets go when they leave? They go to the *Unicorn Realm*. It is a
hall of fame for pets that have gone, and it is a kind place. It keeps the
last #v("REALM_MAX_PETS") pets: their names, their kinds, how long they
stayed and what they were like. Nobody there ever has to wash.

You can visit at any time: Main screen, #w("Bornagotchi"), #w("Unicorn Realm").
@ch-realm shows what you will find there.
Your pet's name goes in the book when it leaves, so choose a good one.
